{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/789668-unterzee-from-sunless-sea-as-a-lair","id":789668,"title":"Unterzee (From Sunless Sea) as a Lair","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-12-20T03:45:13-08:00","id":789668,"title":"Unterzee (From Sunless Sea) as a Lair","content":"I had an idea awhile ago while playing Sunless Sea, and that is: what if the Unterzee was a very large lair formed by a powerful Makara (Maybe the Eye is a collector of people!), and other Beasts joined in the fun. The Islands and continents of the Unterzee being the various chambers of the Lair, while the ocean itself acting as the connections. Places like the Cumaean Canal, Avid Horizon's, and Codex could be passages to various realms of the World of Darkness.<br /> <br /> \u200bMy main problem with my idea, can ordinary humans live inside a lair provided the Lair has features that include things like food. And if so, could a potential chronicle be set around this?<br /> <br /> I imagine that such a Lair would have quite a few problems with Heros, (maybe the Captain of various ships are all Heros braving the sea).<br /> <br /> Anyone else have any thoughts?<br /> <br /> Mummy's of course would be very interested to learn about Irem, (maybe this Makara achieved it's interitence a long time ago and is in fact just the Beast now, no Man), while Vampires have the obvious interest in a large amount of people in a place with no sunlight. The Uttershroom and Port Cecil are probably related to Namtaru.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>If I post any good ideas regarding house rules feel free to use them! Giving me credit is optional! All I want is people to have fun!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4737-afro-luigi","name":"Afro Luigi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4737_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"86"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}